      "content": "<h2>The Value of Design Systems</h2>\n<p>Consistent typography, intuitive color hierarchy, and predictable interaction models reduce user cognitive load and accelerate purchase or lead generation conversions.</p>\n\n<h3>Designing for Clarity & Accessibility</h3>\n<p>High-converting interfaces prioritize high-contrast typography, clear visual affordances, and accessible WCAG AAA standards across both desktop and mobile viewports.</p>\n\n<h3>Micro-Interactions That Delight</h3>\n<p>Thoughtful feedback on button clicks, progress indicators during multi-step forms, and smooth state transitions build trust and user confidence.</p>",
